          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Organize your workflow</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Adapt to your workflow and streamline reporting with custom checklists</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reach care milestones with configurable time goals to help comply with protocols and accreditations</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
